    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the \"quiet\" you're talking about... i think about it all the time now. not just a vacation or a weekend off, but just... total silence. no more emails, no more decisions, no more feeling like i have to carry this entire company on my back. it feels like the only thing that would actually work. everything else just feels like a temporary fix.",
